---
title: "exchange_rate + mint_ctokens + burn_ctokens (Current Finance: Reserve)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_supply: total_supply == 0?
    q_check_supply --> q_initial: exchange_rate = 1.0
    q_check_supply --> q_calc: numerator = cash + debt - cash_reserve

    q_initial --> q_mint_path: mint_ctokens path
    q_calc --> q_denominator: denominator = total_supply
    q_denominator --> q_divide: exchange_rate = numerator / denominator
    q_divide --> q_mint_path: mint_ctokens path

    q_mint_path --> q_check_coin: assert coin.value gt 0
    q_check_coin --> q_calc_mint: mint_amount = int_div(coin.value, exchange_rate)
    q_calc_mint --> q_deposit: deposit_underlying(coin) -- cash += value
    q_deposit --> q_increase: increase_ctoken_supply(mint_amount)
    q_increase --> q_return_ctoken: return Balance of CToken
    q_return_ctoken --> [*]

    q_divide --> q_burn_path: burn_ctokens path
    q_burn_path --> q_check_burn: assert ctoken.value gt 0
    q_check_burn --> q_calc_redeem: redeem_amount = exchange_rate.int_mul(ctoken.value)
    q_calc_redeem --> q_decrease: decrease_ctoken_supply(ctoken_balance)
    q_decrease --> q_withdraw: withdraw_underlying(redeem_amount)
    q_withdraw --> q_check_cash: assert cash gte cash_reserve after withdraw
    q_check_cash --> q_return_coin: return Balance of underlying
    q_return_coin --> [*]

    note right of q_divide
        INV-001: exchange_rate = (cash + debt - cash_reserve) / total_supply
        INV-002: exchange_rate is monotonically non-decreasing (interest accrual)
        INV-003: cash must always be gte cash_reserve.ceil()
        INV-004: total_supply tracks total CTokens in circulation
        INV-005: First depositor gets 1:1 rate, subsequent get market rate
    end note
